alarm /dev/alarm/heater /dev/alarm/check -w /dev/alarm/sensor /dev/alarm/temphigh /dev/alarm/templow
(one character per 150 ms: # buzzer sounding, . quiet)

all off                                      ....................  LED off
templow warn: beeps                          ##................................##...............................##...........  LED lit
templow on: continuous                       ####################  LED lit
back to warn: beeps again                    ##................................##....  LED lit
MUTE: quiet, LED lit                         ........................................  LED lit
a minute after MUTE: beeps again at once     ##................................##....  LED lit
cleared                                      ....................  LED off
a warn before -w: quiet                      ........................................  LED off
room warn (not listed): quiet                ........................................  LED off
sensor warn (safe, after -w): beeps          ##................................##....  LED lit
sensor on (none): continuous                 ####################  LED lit
heater on + temphigh warn: continuous        ####################  LED lit
exit 0
